alsikes:
-s form of alsike
n. A species of clover with pinkish or white flowers;
   Trifolium hybridum.

infold:
v. t. To wrap up or cover with folds; to envelop; to inwrap;
   to inclose; to involve.
v. t. To clasp with the arms; to embrace.

japhetic:
a. Pertaining to, or derived from, Japheth, one of the sons
   of Noah; as, Japhetic nations, the nations of Europe and Northern Asia;
   Japhetic languages.

tabetic:
a. Of or pertaining to tabes; of the nature of tabes;
   affected with tabes; tabid.
n. One affected with tabes.
